# Routes answered by the application shell, with a 200 and the address kept.
#
# Stations and journeys have no file each: there are tens of thousands of them,
# and a file per entity took the deployment past the host's 20,000 file limit.
# The app renders these pages, and their heads, from the data packs.
#
# The target is `/`, never `/index.html`. Cloudflare Pages redirects
# `/index.html` to `/`, so a rewrite to it does not keep the address. Rules win
# over files here, so no rule may cover a path that has its own file.
/stations/*  /  200
/journey/*   /  200
